WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
In RAG, you have more state control than in an LLM.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Here's what makes a RAG agentic.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Instead of using hard-coded pipelines that say, “Do this, do this, do this, and this,”

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
we're going to use an agent that says, “Here is an LLM. Here is a RAG tool.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.000
And maybe here's a web search tool or whatever.”

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Now, what I want you to do is take the data,

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
get the data, input the data, and then be able to search the data.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.000
And then it just uses these tools to do these tasks, and you don't tell it...
